Here are the different commands to generate the dataset 

1. Create new datasets by creating a .json file 
```python
uv run --no-sync python -m domainbed.prepare_data.create_json
```

2. Generate the audio dataset from .json file
uv run python -m domainbed.prepare_data.rebuild_dataset --dataset_info domainbed/prepare_data/noisy_CWWS_train_small.json

```python
uv run python -m domainbed.prepare_data.rebuild_dataset --dataset_info domainbed/prepare_data/noisy_CWWS_validation.json
```

```python
uv run python -m domainbed.prepare_data.rebuild_dataset --dataset_info domainbed/prepare_data/noisy_CWWS_train_mono.json
```

```python
uv run python -m domainbed.prepare_data.rebuild_dataset --dataset_info domainbed/prepare_data/noisy_CWWS_test.json
```


## Homemade script to rebuild dataset from json file
rebuild_domainbed_dataset --dataset-info domainbed/prepare_data/noisy_CWWS_test.json